Source Files: bitAdder.c nounFinder.c
Compile and Run Instructions:
                              For bitAdder.c
                              1. Open gnome-terminal
                              2. Go to the directory containing the source files
                              3. type: "gcc -Wall -o bitAdder bitAdder.c"  to check for any errors
                              4. type: "./bitAdder" to run the program bitAdder

                              For nounFinder.c
                              1. Open gnome-terminal
                              2. Go to the directory containing the source files
                              3. type: "gcc -Wall -o nounFinder nounFinder.c"  to check for any errors
                              4. type: "./nounFinder" to run the program nounFinder
